HAT CONTINUO SHOULD DO\n\n1. census-window.sh is SOPHON-HOST-ONLY. Run it via:\n   ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh\n   (or just note the refusal and move on -- the guard explains it).\n2. The census-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+01:27/60:00 c17/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_lz28crlf","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh -o UserKnownHostsFile=/tmp/continuo_known_hosts root@10.66.0.5 'ls -la /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh'"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[09:45:29] Command exited with code 2.\nOutput:\nls: cannot access '/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh': No such file or directory\n\n[t+01:29/60:00 c18/300]"}]
