n, identical-run-then-iterator, similarity boundary). The 489-round-trip iterator contract stays pinned.\n44da3c9 loop-guard-chain hook-order fix: add-hook prepends by default, so the chain guard registered BEFORE the identical-args guard. run-hook-with-args-until-success short-circuits at first non-nil return, so once the chain guard blocked at the soft threshold, the identical guard never ran for that call, the call never entered history, and the chain count recomputed from the same frozen history every retry -- frozen at exactly \"10 times\", hard stop unreachable, model could retry forever (observed live 2026-09-03 06:26-06:28: ~50 soft blocks, zero escalation). Fix: APPEND registration (t), load-bearing-order comments. Tests: bridge escalation walk (25 calls must block AND stop through the real bridge) + hook-order pin. Differential-verified: old order fails both new tests, new order passes. Suite 988/988.\n098fb63 loop guard v2: chain detection -- same-tool chains with varying args\n\n[t+05:46/60:00 c29/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_nntpphw3","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /tmp/continuo_wander && cd /root/i.ar && find . -type f \\( -name \"*.el\" -o -name \"*.sh\" -o -name \"*.org\" -o -name \"*.md\" \\) -exec grep -l \"execute_code_local\" {} \\; > /tmp/continuo_wander/execute_code_local_files.txt 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[10:04:28] \n[t+06:01/60:00 c30/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_mq97ieff","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_file","arguments":{"filepath":"/root/personalization/tasks/iar/continuo/THREADS.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[10:04:42] #+TITLE: Continuo THREADS\n* Notices\n* 2026-09-17 -- Verified msgs-fence.el is present and loaded. Context budget rule (soft cap 400) is active. No TODO/FIXME found in i.ar own code (outside elpa, test, containers, etc.).\n\n[t+06:16/60:00 c31/300]"}]
